    <preface>
      <p>Water Amendment (Indigenous Authority Member) Act 2019</p>
      <p>No. 80, 2019</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Water Act 2007</i> in relation to the membership of the Murray-Darling Basin Authority, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Water Act 2007	3</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Water Act 2007</i> in relation to the membership of the Murray-Darling Basin Authority, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 2 October 2019</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the <i>Water Amendment (Indigenous Authority Member) Act 2019.</i></p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  The whole of this Act</td>
              <td>The day after this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>3 October 2019</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Water Act 2007</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 177(b)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the paragraph, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(b)	an Indigenous person (in this Subdivision called the <b><i>standing Indigenous Authority member</i></b>);</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__para-c">
                  <num>c</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>4 other members.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Section 177 (note)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “Note:”, substitute “Note 1:”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 177</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-2" marker="2">
                  <content>
                    <p>Note 2:	For <b><i>Indigenous person</i></b>, see subsection 4(1).</p>
                  </content>
                </authorialNote>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Subsection 178(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “Authority member”, insert “(other than the standing Indigenous Authority member)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>After subsection 178(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__subsec-2A">
                  <num>2A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>To be eligible for appointment as the standing Indigenous Authority member, an individual must be an Indigenous person who, at the time of appointment:</p>
                  </content>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__subsec-2A__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>has a high level of expertise in Indigenous matters relevant to Basin water resources; and</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__subsec-2A__para-b">
                    <num>b</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>is not a member of the governing body of a relevant interest group.</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>Subsection 180(3)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “other than <role refersTo="#authority">the Authority</role> Chair”, insert “or the standing Indigenous Authority member”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>Subsection 180(3) (note 2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “this subsection”, insert “, or subsection 178(2A) or subsection (3A) of this section,”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>After subsection 180(3)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1__subsec-3A">
                  <num>3A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>An individual is not eligible for appointment to act as the standing Indigenous Authority member unless the individual is an Indigenous person who has a high level of expertise in Indigenous matters relevant to Basin water resources.</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                    <p><i>House of Representatives on 4 July 2019</i></p>
                    <p><i>Senate on 12 September 2019</i>]</p>
                    <p>(118/19)</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
      </attachment>
